OL,3,GNEWSAPanel concerned housing minister
OL,4,Anot 'up to speed'
OL,5,
OL,6,FA scrutiny panel has raised concerns
OL,7,Fthe housing minister "isn't up to
OL,8,Fspeed" with his remit.
OL,10,FThe environment, housing and
OL,11,Finfrastructure scrutiny panel issued
OL,12,Fthe statement after a hearing with the
OL,13,Fminister Deputy Malcolm Ferey on
OL,14,FThursday morning.
OL,23,APub: 23-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
