OL,3,GNEWSAPanel concerned housing minister
OL,4,Anot 'up to speed'
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe panel's responsibilities include
OL,7,Freviewing the work of the housing
OL,8,Fminister and its concerns include how
OL,9,Fhe prioritises house building, and over
OL,10,Fthe fact he has not met with
OL,11,Forganisations involved in tackling
OL,12,Fhomelessness despite an increase in
OL,13,Fhomelessness.
OL,15,FIn response, Ferey said he "did not
OL,16,Fwish to comment further at this time".
